## 6. Core Features

### Faculty Registration & Authentication
- Email-based registration with password hashing (werkzeug.security)
- Secure session management with configurable timeout
- Password change functionality with current password verification
- Account status management (active/inactive) controlled by admin

### Content Management
Every content type follows a consistent pattern:
- **Create** — Add new content through forms
- **Read** — View content in organized layouts
- **Update** — Edit existing content
- **Delete** — Remove content with confirmation
- **Toggle visibility** — Switch between published (public) and draft (private)

Content types include: Qualifications, Research Interests, Achievements, Publications, Courses, Course Materials, Research Students, Projects, Announcements, Messages, and Resources (standalone PDFs/videos).

### File Upload System
- Supports images (PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP), documents (PDF, DOC, DOCX), presentations (PPT, PPTX), code files, and video formats (MP4, WebM, AVI, MOV, MKV)
- Maximum upload size: 100 MB (configurable)
- Automatic filename deduplication using hex tokens
- Organized storage in categorized subdirectories

### Notification System
- Flash messages for user feedback (success, danger, warning, info)
- Auto-dismissing flash messages in the admin panel
- Confirmation dialogs for destructive actions

