- is_active, is_detached, detached_at, created_at

**platform_admins** — Administrator accounts
- id, username, password_hash, role, created_at

**qualifications** — Academic qualifications
- id, faculty_id, degree, specialization, university, year_of_passing, certificate_photo, is_published

**research_interests** — Research areas
- id, faculty_id, title, description, is_published

**achievements** — Awards and achievements
- id, faculty_id, title, description, category, year, certificate_photo, is_published

**publications** — Academic publications
- id, faculty_id, title, authors, journal, year, doi, url, abstract, pub_type, is_published

**courses** — Taught courses
- id, faculty_id, name, code, description, semester, schedule, is_published

**course_materials** — Uploaded course files
- id, course_id, faculty_id, title, file_path, file_type, description, uploaded_at

**students** — Research students
- id, faculty_id, name, program, research_topic, status, start_year, email, is_published

**projects** — Research projects
- id, faculty_id, title, description, funding_agency, amount, status, start_year, end_year, is_published

**announcements** — Faculty announcements
- id, faculty_id, title, content, is_important, is_published, created_at

**messages** — Student contact form submissions
- id, faculty_id, sender_name, sender_email, subject, message, is_read, created_at

**resources** — Standalone PDFs and videos
- id, faculty_id, title, description, resource_type, file_path, url, is_published, created_at

**activity_logs** — Audit trail
- id, user_type, user_id, action, details, ip_address, timestamp

**threats** — Security threat detections
- id, threat_type, description, ip_address, severity, is_resolved, detected_at

**migration_requests** — Migration applications
- id, faculty_id, status, reason, target_email, hosting_provider, hosting_plan, custom_domain, admin_notes, reviewed_by, created_at, reviewed_at

**verification_codes** — Email verification for migrations
- id, faculty_id, email, code, purpose, is_used, expires_at, created_at

**backup_history** — Backup records
- id, backup_type, file_path, file_size, status, created_by, notes, created_at

**platform_settings** — Key-value configuration store
- key, value

### Design Principles
- All content tables have `is_published` for draft/publish control
- `faculty_id` foreign key on all content tables
- `ON DELETE CASCADE` ensures data cleanup
- Timestamps on all records for audit purposes
- Independent database copies preserve all IDs for referential integrity

