## 13. Technology Stack

**Backend:**
- Python 3.13
- Flask (web framework)
- SQLite (database)
- werkzeug (password hashing, file uploads, WSGI utilities)
- Jinja2 (templating, included with Flask)

**Frontend:**
- HTML5
- CSS3 (custom properties, grid, flexbox, transitions)
- Vanilla JavaScript (no frameworks)
- SVG icons (inline)

**No external JavaScript frameworks or libraries are used.** The frontend is built entirely with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for maximum simplicity and zero dependency management.

**Deployment:**
- Render.com compatible (render.yaml present)
- Self-contained — single Python file with SQLite
- No external database server required
- No Redis, Celery, or background workers needed

